---
import Main from "../layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import FeatureCard from "../components/FeatureCard.astro";
---

<Main title="About - Aurora Nyxus" description="Aurora Nyxus is an independent Canadian AI compute builder. We build the boxes, mesh the capacity, and deploy sovereign on-prem systems. We run our own workloads on our own hardware.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="We build the compute we wanted to own"
    lede="Aurora Nyxus started with a simple problem: renting cloud inference at thousands a month made no sense when Ontario power is cheap and the hardware can live where you trust it. So we built it. Now we build it for others."
    fig="Fig. — About"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">The origin</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Customer zero is us. Nightly agentic workflows were costing about
          {"$5,000"} a month on a hyperscaler. We priced a build, ran the math,
          and committed: a multi-GPU node meshed with spare hardware, hosted on
          a fast Canadian connection, breaking even in months. The system we
          built for ourselves is the product we now build for you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">The conviction</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Compute you depend on should be compute you own, on soil you trust.
          Canada sits low in the global hardware queue, so we are scrappy: we
          mesh old and new hardware into capacity, and we build an
          Oxide-class standard of engineering at workstation and node scale,
          climbing toward rack scale.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10">
    <h2 class="font-display mb-6 text-2xl font-medium text-ink">What we stand on</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <FeatureCard title="Independent" index="01" accent="green">A founder-owned Canadian venture, not a reseller.</FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Engineering-first" index="02" accent="signal">Precision builds, stress-tested, documented. No RGB theatre.</FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Sovereign" index="03" accent="violet">Canadian custody and CLOUD-Act-free deployment, with DAI Compute.</FeatureCard>
      <FeatureCard title="Honest" index="04" accent="green">We show the break-even math and name the tradeoffs.</FeatureCard>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-20 pt-6">
    <p class="text-sm text-graphite">
      Aurora Nyxus is part of a Canadian venture group and partners with
      <a href="https://daicompute.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-aurora-green hover:underline">DAI Compute</a>
      on sovereign infrastructure. Meet the team on the
      <a href="/contact" class="text-aurora-green hover:underline">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Main>
